  "releaseNotes": "Export. Board supported.\nExport. BoardState supported.\nImport. Fix transactions. Board state supported.\nStorage binary. Fix handle zero prices.\nCandleCsvSerializer. Removed time based aggregation.\nCSV serializers. Tick precision.\nMarketEmulator. TIF=FOK fix.\nMarketEmulator. Fix candle orders.\nMarketEmulator. VerifyMode property.\nMarketEmulator. PostOnly orders supported.\nMarketEmulator. Fill Balance, OrderVolume for matched order replies.\nMarketEmulator. Fix expirable orders.\nStrategy calc positions itself.\nMarketEmulator. Removed positions calculation.\nBasketMessageAdapter. IsSupportPositionEmulation == false by default.\nSubscriptionOnlineMessageAdapter fixes.\nPnLManager. Fix save load.\nPnLManager. Fix multi market data type mode.\nIPnLManager. PnL -> GetPnL\nFix volume profile.\nVolume profile fixes.\nCandleBuilder. Fix fill TotalVolume.\nQuotingProcessor. Fix LeftVolume calc.\nExpressionIndexSecurity. Fix clear InnerSecurityIds\nLatencyManager fixes.\nDerivativesHelper fixes.\nBasketStrike. FilterStrikes fix.\nCandlePatternFileStorage fixes.\nAverageDrawdownParameter fix.\nGeneticSettings. Probability validation fixes.\nFix indentation to tabs\nAlligatorLine. Fix default state.\nIMessageAdapter. UseChannels -> UseInChannel + UseOutChannel.\nOrderLogGenerator fixes.\nOL storage. Supported TradeVolume\nrestore param tags\nINewsProvider removed.\nPortfolioMessage. Removed subscribe logic.\nIMessageAdapter. Inverted logic of SupportedResultMessages property.\nSubscriptionOnlineMessageAdapter. Fix response for non md subscriptions.\nRemoved explicit Now usage.\nISubscriptionMessage. SpecificItemRequest\nStrategy. PositionChanged marked as obsolete.\nConnector. KeepStrategiesPositions marked as obsolete.\nStrategy. Fix handle own trades.",
